<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#fff4d8">
  <title>La Ferme du Soleil</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --bg: #fff5df;
      --panel: #fffdf7;
      --panel-2: #f8efdc;
      --text: #403328;
      --muted: #786853;
      --line: #e9d7b6;
      --green: #4e9955;
      --green-soft: #dcefcf;
      --accent: #e8764d;
      --accent-dark: #bd5333;
      --gold: #f2b83f;
      --danger: #b44d45;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(91, 61, 30, .12);
    }

    html[data-theme="dark"] {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --bg: #121a17;
      --panel: #1e2a24;
      --panel-2: #27362e;
      --text: #f7f0df;
      --muted: #c0b6a3;
      --line: #405047;
      --green: #79bd72;
      --green-soft: #2d4733;
      --accent: #f08b64;
      --accent-dark: #ffad8d;
      --gold: #f4c657;
      --danger: #ff9d91;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    [hidden] { display: none !important; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: ui-rounded, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.35;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    button {
      font: inherit;
      color: inherit;
      touch-action: manipulation;
    }

    button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--gold);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .app {
      width: min(100%, 900px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 8px 12px calc(30px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    }

    /* Bandeau de ferme */
    .scene {
      position: relative;
      height: 154px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(#82d5f4 0%, #c9eff8 68%, #9dca68 69%, #77aa50 100%);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      isolation: isolate;
      transition: background .5s ease;
    }

    .scene::before,
    .scene::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      z-index: -1;
      border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
    }

    .scene::before {
      width: 85%;
      height: 65px;
      left: -15%;
      bottom: 17px;
      background: #8abd5d;
      transform: rotate(5deg);
    }

    .scene::after {
      width: 90%;
      height: 70px;
      right: -20%;
      bottom: 12px;
      background: #6fa54c;
      transform: rotate(-5deg);
    }

    .scene.night {
      background: linear-gradient(#17264d 0%, #44577a 68%, #52734c 69%, #344e38 100%);
    }

    .scene.night::before { background: #466841; }
    .scene.night::after { background: #365737; }

    .scene span {
      position: absolute;
      display: block;
      user-select: none;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .14));
    }

    .celestial {
      top: 12px;
      right: 18px;
      font-size: 2.6rem;
      animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .cloud-a { top: 18px; left: 24%; font-size: 1.8rem; opacity: .8; }
    .cloud-b { top: 42px; right: 29%; font-size: 1.25rem; opacity: .65; }
    .night .cloud-a, .night .cloud-b { opacity: .25; }

    .house { left: 4%; bottom: 26px; font-size: 3.8rem; }
    .tree { left: 29%; bottom: 28px; font-size: 3.25rem; }
    .tractor { left: 43%; bottom: 21px; font-size: 2.6rem; }
    .cow { right: 28%; bottom: 20px; font-size: 2.25rem; }
    .pig { right: 18%; bottom: 18px; font-size: 1.85rem; }
    .sheep { right: 9%; bottom: 22px; font-size: 2rem; }
    .sunflower { right: 2%; bottom: 16px; font-size: 2.6rem; }

    @keyframes float {
      50% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
    }

    /* En-tête et statistiques */
    .header {
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: var(--panel);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .brand-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 5vw, 1.55rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .brand-row p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    .icon-button {
      flex: 0 0 48px;
      min-height: 48px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.45fr .9fr;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 13px;
    }

    .stat {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 9px 8px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .7rem;
    }

    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .xp-text {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .66rem;
    }

    .xp-track, .meter {
      display: block;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(125, 108, 80, .2);
    }

    .xp-track {
      height: 7px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .xp-track i, .meter i {
      display: block;
      width: 0;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), #91c956);
      transition: width .25s linear;
    }

    /* Sections */
    main {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .panel {
      padding: 15px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: var(--panel);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      font-size: 1.12rem;
    }

    .section-head p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .78rem;
    }

    .badge {
      flex: none;
      max-width: 45%;
      padding: 6px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--green-soft);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Graines et parcelles */
    .seed-scroll {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 0 -15px 14px;
      padding: 2px 15px 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
      scrollbar-width: thin;
    }

    .seed {
      flex: 0 0 94px;
      min-height: 86px;
      padding: 7px 5px;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .seed.selected {
      border-color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-soft);
    }

    .seed:disabled {
      cursor: not-allowed;
      filter: grayscale(.55);
      opacity: .58;
    }

    .seed-emoji {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    .seed-name {
      display: block;
      font-size: .77rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .seed-status {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .65rem;
    }

    .plot-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .plot {
      position: relative;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 76px;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      padding: 7px 3px 13px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 2px solid rgba(91, 61, 30, .12);
      border-radius: 17px;
      color: #403328;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .15s ease, filter .15s ease;
    }

    .plot:active { transform: scale(.96); }
    .plot.empty { background: #e8cc9d; }
    .plot.growing { background: #cfe5a6; }
    .plot.watered { background: #b9dfd2; }
    .plot.ready {
      border-color: #e4a62d;
      background: #ffe398;
      animation: readyPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes readyPulse {
      50% { filter: brightness(1.08); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    }

    .plot-emoji {
      display: block;
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 7vw, 2rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .plot-label {
      display: block;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-size: .7rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .plot-sub {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-size: .58rem;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .plot .meter {
      position: absolute;
      right: 7px;
      bottom: 6px;
      left: 7px;
      height: 5px;
      background: rgba(66, 51, 34, .18);
    }

    /* Animaux */
    .animal-list, .quest-list, .order-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .animal-card, .quest-card, .order-card {
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }

    .animal-card.locked { opacity: .78; }

    .animal-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
    }

    .animal-icon { font-size: 2rem; }
    .animal-name { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
    .animal-name h3 { margin-bottom: 1px; font-size: 1rem; }
    .animal-name p { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .7rem; }

    .count-pill {
      flex: none;
      padding: 4px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--panel);
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .animal-product {
      margin: 9px 0 7px;
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .animal-card .meter, .quest-card .meter {
      height: 9px;
    }

    .animal-meta, .quest-progress-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .72rem;
    }

    .actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .btn {
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 9px 11px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn.primary {
      background: var(--green);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn.secondary {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--panel);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .btn.accent {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn:disabled {
      cursor: not-allowed;
      filter: grayscale(.45);
      opacity: .48;
    }

    /* Quêtes */
    .quest-card.complete { border-color: var(--green); }

    .quest-title {
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      font-size: .88rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .quest-reward {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .75rem;
    }

    .quest-card .btn {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* Stock */
    .stock-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .stock-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      font-size: .76rem;
    }

    .stock-chip strong { color: var(--green); }
    .empty-message { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }

    /* Commandes */
    .order-card.ready { border-color: var(--green); }

    .order-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .order-head h3 { margin-bottom: 0; font-size: .95rem; }

    .order-pay {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .7rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .order-items {
      display: grid;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .order-item {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: var(--panel);
      font-size: .8rem;
    }

    .order-stock { flex: none; font-weight: 850; color: var(--green); }
    .order-item.missing .order-stock { color: var(--danger); }

    footer {
      padding: 20px 8px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .72rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Messages */
    .toasts {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 100;
      right: 12px;
      bottom: calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
      left: 12px;
      display: grid;
      justify-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .toast {
      max-width: min(92vw, 430px);
      padding: 11px 15px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(42, 38, 31, .94);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      animation: toastIn .2s ease-out;
    }

    @keyframes toastIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
    }

    @media (min-width: 620px) {
      .scene { height: 180px; }
      .house { font-size: 4.7rem; }
      .tree { font-size: 4rem; }
      .tractor { font-size: 3.2rem; }
      .cow { font-size: 2.8rem; }
      .pig, .sheep { font-size: 2.35rem; }
      .plot-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .animal-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .quest-list, .order-list { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .order-card .actions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 370px) {
      .app { padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; }
      .panel, .header { padding: 12px; }
      .seed-scroll { margin-right: -12px; margin-left: -12px; padding-right: 12px; padding-left: 12px; }
      .stats { gap: 5px; }
      .stat { padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; }
      .stat strong { font-size: .88rem; }
      .plot-grid { gap: 6px; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        animation: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
    <div class="scene" id="scene" role="img" aria-label="La ferme en journée">
      <span class="celestial" id="celestial" aria-hidden="true">☀️</span>
      <span class="cloud-a" aria-hidden="true">☁️</span>
      <span class="cloud-b" aria-hidden="true">☁️</span>
      <span class="house" aria-hidden="true">🏡</span>
      <span class="tree" aria-hidden="true">🌳</span>
      <span class="tractor" aria-hidden="true">🚜</span>
      <span class="cow" aria-hidden="true">🐄</span>
      <span class="pig" aria-hidden="true">🐖</span>
      <span class="sheep" aria-hidden="true">🐑</span>
      <span class="sunflower" aria-hidden="true">🌻</span>
    </div>

    <header class="header">
      <div class="brand-row">
        <div>
          <h1>🌻 La Ferme du Soleil</h1>
          <p>Une petite ferme pleine de douceur</p>
        </div>
        <button class="icon-button" id="themeBtn" type="button" aria-label="Passer en mode sombre">🌙</button>
      </div>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-label">Pièces</span>
          <strong>🪙 <span id="coins">0</span></strong>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-label" id="levelText">Niveau 1</span>
          <div class="xp-track" id="xpTrack" role="progressbar" aria-label="Expérience" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="50" aria-valuenow="0">
            <i id="xpFill"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="xp-text" id="xpText">0 / 50 XP</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-label">Série</span>
          <strong>🔥 <span id="streakText">0</span></strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="panel">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>🌱 Les champs</h2>
            <p>Plantez, arrosez une fois, puis récoltez.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="badge" id="selectedSeed">🥕 Carotte</span>
        </div>
        <div class="seed-scroll" id="seedBar" aria-label="Graines disponibles"></div>
        <div class="plot-grid" id="plotGrid" aria-label="20 parcelles"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>🐾 Les animaux</h2>
            <p>Chaque animal accélère la production. Réserve : 3 produits par animal.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="animal-list" id="animalList"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>📜 Quêtes du jour</h2>
            <p id="dailyInfo">Nouvelles quêtes à minuit.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="badge">🎁 15 XP / quête</span>
        </div>
        <div class="quest-list" id="questList"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>🧺 La grange</h2>
            <p>Les produits en stock servent à remplir les commandes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stock-list" id="stockList"></div>
        <p class="empty-message" id="stockEmpty">Le stock est vide. Aux champs !</p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>🚚 Commandes des clients</h2>
            <p>Livraison payée 2,2 × la valeur des produits, avec bonus d’XP.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="order-list" id="orderList"></div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      🌙 Les cultures et les animaux progressent pendant votre absence.<br>
      Sauvegarde automatique sur cet appareil.
    </footer>
  </div>

  <div class="toasts" id="toasts" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <script>
